Do not mutate canonical 00.live, the goal/assignment record, existing work reviews,
old captures or another lane. Derived views may be written to an explicit new
candidate location and must identify their source and noncanonical status.

Prepare COLD-PRIME-COLAB.md and separate disposable fixture/evaluator materials for
later use. Candidate entry explains project purpose, temporary Colab role, available
tools, known gaps, permissions and return route; it is not a hidden exam. Include
complete/open/held/new-return situations and one bounded review to record/recover.
Keep evaluator expectations out of the candidate reading order. Do not allocate an
actual N7NN trial, reserve its return, start a session or run a model now. Current
Prime must review and use the integration before that Colab is launched.

